<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 21 August <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/baldwin-ii-of-jerusalem"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/baldwin-ii-of-jerusalem.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Baldwin II of Jerusalem</span><span class="tp">d. 1131</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alfonso-vii-of-leon-and-castile"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alfonso-vii-of-leon-and-castile.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alfonso VII of León and Castile</span><span class="tp">1105–1157</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alphonse-count-of-poitiers"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alphonse-count-of-poitiers.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alphonse, Count of Poitiers</span><span class="tp">1220–1271</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/philippe-villiers-de-lisle-adam"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/philippe-villiers-de-lisle-adam.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Philippe Villiers de L'Isle-Adam</span><span class="tp">1464–1534</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jean-parisot-de-valette"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jean-parisot-de-valette.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jean Parisot de Valette</span><span class="tp">1495–1568</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/zahir-al-umar"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/zahir-al-umar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Zahir al-Umar</span><span class="tp">c. 1690–1775</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/leon-trotsky"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leon-trotsky.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Leon Trotsky</span><span class="tp">1879–1940</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
